    <tr>
      <td colspan=10>
        <ul>  
          <li>Giants and Spectres are Roughly level 35 and can be found in Oasis</li>
          <li>Giants can be found in North Karana, Oasis, West Commons, Everfrost
          (Perma Zone), and South Ro</li>
          <li>Spectres can also be found near the Plane of Fear entrance in The
          Feerrott</li>
        </ul>  
        <ul>
          <li>Many Dungeons have creatures closer to the level within the dungeon
          guarding the entrance outside</li>
          <li>This Chart does not included special or named NPC's such as guards,
          bards, rare spawns, etc.</li>
          <li>This Chart is only giving a rough estimate of what level a player
          (or groups starting at level 20) can receive xp in the zone</li>
          <li>When in doubt give an /ooc or /shout to ask "What is there to fight
          in this zone at level ##?"</li>
          <li>Warslik's Wood, Ill Omen, Swamp of No Hope, and Field of Bone all
          cater to levels between 1 to 12, and often times can exceed that limit
          as well. These zones all have guards near one entrance who will attack
          non-iksars.</li>
          <li>This Chart is not designed with solo play in mind after level 15,
          though the general rule would be: If a party of players can get experience
          off it, so can an individual solo'ing. Whether or not you can solo is another
          story completely.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Unofficially, creatures in Kunark hit harder per hit but seem more
          likely to drop better cash loot and items that sell well to merchants.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>&nbsp;</p>  
